      "beat_id": "B01",
      "act": "WRITER",
      "narration_text": "Muse is a cloud AI agent. You give it a goal, and it works through the steps on its own computer in the cloud. That makes it useful for long, heavy jobs, like building 3D assets, that would otherwise tie up your own machine.",
