    {
      "beat_id": "B10",
      "act": "COMPARE",
      "narration_text": "How does it compare with Claude Code? Claude Code works on your own machine and uses its resources. Muse works in the cloud. Muse's underlying AI model is not Sonnet or Opus, so it's best suited to simpler tasks.",
