    {
      "beat_id": "B11",
      "act": "USES",
      "narration_text": "So how could you use it? Offload heavy jobs to the cloud. Run long tasks overnight. Get quick first-draft prototypes and assets, then refine them by hand. And pair it with other tools, for example Brutalist, for making videos.",
