    {
      "beat_id": "B12",
      "act": "CAUTIONS",
      "narration_text": "Three cautions. AI output must be verified by a person. An agent that runs code can be risky if it has too much access, so give it only what the job needs. And say what the AI did. You should be able to explain every part of your work.",
