    {
      "beat_id": "B14",
      "act": "RECAP",
      "narration_text": "Recap, in three lines. Muse is a cloud AI agent that works the steps on its own virtual machine. It can run Blender, even headless, and Godot, and make 3D models, prototypes and art. Use it for heavy, long or first-draft work, then refine and check it yourself.",
